#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropad-t430.rst:10
#: e765abf0fffa4f6c84a071b2177fdc9f
msgid ""
"**Warning:** The CPU in this computer no longer receives microcode updates "
"from Intel. Without microcode updates, Qubes OS cannot ensure that this "
"computer is secure against CPU vulnerabilities. While this computer remains "
"certified for Qubes OS Release 4, we recommend that prospective buyers "
"consider a newer Qubes-certified computer instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropad-t430.rst:14
#: abb5cbf490704212a399cfb512c86572
msgid ""
"**Note:** Please be advised that the i7-3632QM option is not compatible with "
"Qubes OS, as it does not support VT-d. The option specifically tested by the "
"Qubes team is the i5-3320M."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropad-t430.rst:16
